&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;The LLM Leaderboard has updated its rankings for 2026, evaluating and comparing more than 300 AI models. The ranking aggregates performance across intelligence, output speed, latency, and per-token pricing into a single metric called the LLM Stats Score, utilizing continuous updates from provider APIs and verified benchmarks.&lt;/p&gt;
