&lt;h2 id="-open-weight-model-rankings"&gt;🔓 Open-Weight Model Rankings
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The leaderboard also maintains an independent ranking of open-weight large language models—including Llama, Qwen, GLM, DeepSeek, Mistral, Kimi, and others—evaluated by coding-arena score, GPQA Diamond, throughput, latency, and per-token pricing:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Best Open-Weight / Best on GPQA Diamond&lt;/strong&gt;: Kimi K3 (93.5% GPQA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Best for Coding (Arena)&lt;/strong&gt;: DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731 (24.1 arena score)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Best on AIME 2025&lt;/strong&gt;: Kimi K2-Thinking-0905 (100.0%)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Best on SWE-Bench Verified&lt;/strong&gt;: DeepSeek-V4-Pro-Max (80.6%)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Highest Throughput&lt;/strong&gt;: Mistral Small 4 (73 tok/s)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lowest Latency&lt;/strong&gt;: Mistral Small 4 (1413.90 s)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cheapest Input&lt;/strong&gt;: Mistral NeMo Instruct ($0.02 / 1M tok)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Largest Context Window&lt;/strong&gt;: Kimi K3 (1.0M tokens)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
